    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "ESP32-DevKitC 或 STM32F103C8T6 最小系统板"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "~10~30 元"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "主控芯片"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "ST-Link V2 下载器"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "~10 元"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "给 STM32 烧录程序"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "基础元器件包（电阻/电容/LED/按键等）"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "~20 元"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "实验消耗"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "传感器模块包（温湿度、超声波、OLED、舵机等）"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "~50~100 元"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "做项目"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "可调稳压电源（或先用 USB 供电）"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "~50~80 元"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-28",
      "text": "稳定供电调试"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-29",
      "text": "三条避坑建议"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-29",
      "text": "不要先啃《模拟电子技术》大部头教科书\n零基础看模电很容易劝退。用到什么电路就查什么，以项目驱动学习，遇到不懂的名词再回头补基础。"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-29",
      "text": "不要只看不动手\n嵌入式是\"焊\"出来的，不是\"看\"出来的。哪怕照着视频抄代码、抄电路，也比光看强十倍。遇到 Bug 才是成长最快的时刻。"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-29",
      "text": "尽早学会查数据手册（Datasheet）\n这是从\"爱好者\"进阶到\"工程师\"的分水岭。遇到不懂的传感器，先去淘宝商品页找资料，再直接阅读芯片原厂手册，培养独立解决问题的能力。"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "时间线总览"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "月份"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "阶段"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "里程碑"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "1~2 月"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "家庭电工与电子基础"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "能修台灯、换插座、面包板点亮 LED"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "2~3.5 月"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "C 语言"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "掌握指针、能独立写控制台程序"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "3.5~5.5 月"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "Arduino / ESP32"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "做出蓝牙遥控小车或温湿度监测"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "5.5~9.5 月"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "STM32 进阶"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "掌握 HAL 库、能做多传感器综合项目"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "9.5~12 月"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "PCB 与综合项目"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "画出第一块自己的电路板，做出完整产品"
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "headingId": "section-30",
      "text": "最后提醒：学习周期因人而异，关键是保持每周都有\"看得见\"的产出。哪怕是一个亮起来的 LED，也是继续走下去的动力。"
    }
  ]
}
